ary, secondary, and higher secondary schools. The company also provides various study materials, books, notes, CBSC online preparation, and NCERT solutions; and other courses for agricultural, chess mate, online degrees, and art learning, as well as programes to support students studying hight education in abroad, includes AcadFly. In addition, it operates offline centers; PW talk, a spoken English app; Pi OTT, an academic OTT learning platform; and other platforms, such as Pi lens, Earners, and Gyaane, and News. The company was incorporated in 2020 and is based in Noida, India.","employees":16289,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795256581},"analyst":{"key":"buy","mean":2.1,"n":10,"tMean":147.3,"tHigh":200,"tLow":110,"tMed":146.5,"currency":"INR","asOf":1795256581,"trend":{"strongBuy":3,"buy":4,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":2}},"cap":"Small","caFix":null,"fetched":1795256581,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Physicswallah\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"PhysicsWallah Targets ₹9,000-10,000 Crore Revenue by FY30, Eyes 25%+ Annual Growth","s":"Entrepreneur India","d":1795182340,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxNQ2ZrdmVIN1ZPYUdRem9tbEwwNmN4SEhBSS1pbk9jX3hmalN2aU8teEpzeU5RMWhzZHhKaG54NDFibC1ocktERFhrQ3pLbXJrcUl2RTJKYXRUTVU0Y21lblRpU2phbXQyYlI0dWdqdDlDU0ZreWRhenJhcmFhWnRZZkYwdkVUZm5wRmdzejFSUDRDVUs1VDM5aGg5QzhMRFhneVVvWGhZaEJjNVNJMlhXdzN5b0tHeTBrcGUzblZYYXhiQm8wSWR2bw?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"PhysicsWallah's workforce falls by 400 as AI reshapes content, assessment","s":"ETHRWorld.com","d":1795159292,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"PHYSICSWALLAH LIMITED Share Price - Live NSE: PWL Stock Price & Chart","s":"Upstox","d":1795106014,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTE5heDNtWlVUVDZ6LUdZZ0g3TUhNdzdTcWQzQzBka1FBSk9XRkdhcC01dlVNM0FJdWFWYXF0ckJ4T2wxTkxZc0FYZGNRWk04OVM5eUdpbkxPVDNmMVlqbXlDQ0pVUmRWMTFfUHo3Qw?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"PhysicsWallah to launch digital u